WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:16.303
"Whoa!" gasped.

2
00:00:16.964 --> 00:00:18.024
"Hold on, Muncher!"

3
00:00:18.725 --> 00:00:22.227
He leaped forward and tried to grab one of the donkey's back legs.

4
00:00:22.907 --> 00:00:27.490
The wormhole pulsed with magic energy, trying to suck Muncher into its depths.

5
00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:31.492
"I've never seen a live wormhole before," Raff thought.

6
00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:33.885
"It's scarier than I expected!"

7
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:37.245
There were no wormholes in Stone Wall.

8
00:00:37.846 --> 00:00:43.347
But everyone in Magica could recognize the swirling portals that led into the vortex.

9
00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:49.209
Children were warned not to go near them, since wormholes' energy could be unpredictable.

10
00:00:50.669 --> 00:00:52.550
Just then the wormhole sparked.

11
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.710
Muncher disappeared a little farther into it.

12
00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:58.491
"Help!" Raff cried.

13
00:00:59.411 --> 00:01:01.172
Zella and Loro jumped forward.

14
00:01:01.836 --> 00:01:04.679
Together the three of them pulled the donkey free.

15
00:01:05.599 --> 00:01:08.682
As soon as they moved away, the wormhole swirled shut.

16
00:01:09.703 --> 00:01:11.745
They collapsed a safe distance away.

17
00:01:12.445 --> 00:01:16.529
From here, the wormhole looked like nothing but a faint shimmer in the air.

18
00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.512
But something else caught Raff's eye at the end of the clearing.

19
00:01:20.532 --> 00:01:24.956
"Whoa, I never noticed that before!"

20
00:01:25.456 --> 00:01:25.897
he thought.

21
00:01:26.817 --> 00:01:29.500
Before he could point it out, Zella sprang up.

22
00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:32.390
"Maybe we should go back and test that wormhole."

23
00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:34.471
Loro looked alarmed.

24
00:01:34.491 --> 00:01:36.733
"What do you mean, Zella?"

25
00:01:37.513 --> 00:01:38.074
She grinned.

26
00:01:38.094 --> 00:01:40.896
"We could use it to get to First City.

27
00:01:41.696 --> 00:01:43.618
Or maybe somewhere even more exciting."

28
00:01:43.638 --> 00:01:45.799
"No way!"

29
00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:51.223
Raff knew that the vortex connected all the wormholes in all the worlds.

30
00:01:52.304 --> 00:01:57.748
It could be used to travel long distances quickly—but only if travelers knew what they were doing.

31
00:01:58.716 --> 00:02:00.857
If not, the vortex could be deadly.

32
00:02:01.758 --> 00:02:04.119
Zella was already moving close to the wormhole.

33
00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.041
Raff leaped up and pulled her back.

34
00:02:07.061 --> 00:02:11.043
"Zella, we don't know anything about navigating the vortex.

35
00:02:12.204 --> 00:02:15.686
Mom and Dad said there used to be a wormhole an hour's walk from here.

36
00:02:16.306 --> 00:02:20.089
More than one villager disappeared through it, never to be seen again."

37
00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:25.592
Zella yanked out of Raff's grip, and the wormhole swirled open.

38
00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.121
"Those were just stories to scare us into being good."

39
00:02:29.141 --> 00:02:31.383
"Maybe," Raff said.

40
00:02:31.403 --> 00:02:35.665
"But even Zann didn't jump into the first wormhole he saw, right?"

41
00:02:35.685 --> 00:02:41.228
"It's too dangerous, Zella," Loro said, giving a nervous laugh.

42
00:02:41.248 --> 00:02:43.069
"We just became friends.

43
00:02:43.869 --> 00:02:46.251
I'd hate to have you disappear so soon!"

44
00:02:47.111 --> 00:02:48.732
Zella still looked tempted.

45
00:02:49.553 --> 00:02:51.834
Luckily Raff had a way to distract her.

46
00:02:51.854 --> 00:02:53.455
"Look over there."

47
00:02:54.275 --> 00:02:55.676
He pointed to the end of the clearing.

48
00:02:56.692 --> 00:02:57.452
"Is that a cave?"

49
00:02:58.613 --> 00:03:00.073
The other two turned to look.

50
00:03:01.073 --> 00:03:03.014
"I don't see anything," Zella said.

51
00:03:03.034 --> 00:03:06.235
"Where?" She moved closer to it.

52
00:03:06.255 --> 00:03:07.855
"Stay back!"

53
00:03:08.175 --> 00:03:08.915
Loro snapped.

54
00:03:09.836 --> 00:03:12.976
"If it's a cave, there could be something dangerous inside!"

55
00:03:12.996 --> 00:03:14.697
"I doubt it."

56
00:03:15.597 --> 00:03:17.438
Raff led the way across the clearing.

57
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.258
"There aren't many dangerous animals around here."

58
00:03:20.278 --> 00:03:22.839
"I see it now," Zella said.

59
00:03:22.859 --> 00:03:26.020
"I can't believe we never noticed it before."

60
00:03:26.816 --> 00:03:29.117
"We don't usually come this way," Raff said.

61
00:03:29.137 --> 00:03:33.939
"If Muncher hadn't found that wormhole, we might never have seen the cave either."

62
00:03:35.019 --> 00:03:37.140
Loro hung back, looking anxious.

63
00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.781
"Maybe we should leave it alone.

64
00:03:41.002 --> 00:03:42.762
I'd love to see more of Stone Wall."

65
00:03:42.782 --> 00:03:44.463
"We can do that later."

66
00:03:45.284 --> 00:03:48.385
Zella pushed tall grass away from the cave opening.

67
00:03:49.245 --> 00:03:51.786
Then she snapped her fingers to create friction.

68
00:03:52.807 --> 00:03:56.168
"Light!" A glow appeared at her fingertips.

69
00:03:57.024 --> 00:03:59.265
She used it to look inside the dark cave.

70
00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.827
Raff peered over her shoulder.

71
00:04:01.847 --> 00:04:04.909
"We shouldn't go in there!"

72
00:04:05.309 --> 00:04:06.189
Loro said again.

73
00:04:06.209 --> 00:04:09.491
"Some creature could be living in there."

74
00:04:10.252 --> 00:04:11.713
Raff and Zella ignored him.

75
00:04:11.733 --> 00:04:15.675
"Let's try a Life Force Locator spell," Raff said.

76
00:04:16.455 --> 00:04:17.776
Zella looked confused.

77
00:04:17.796 --> 00:04:19.197
"What's that?"

78
00:04:20.057 --> 00:04:20.938
Raff hesitated.

79
00:04:21.998 --> 00:04:24.340
Trying new magic always made him nervous.

80
00:04:25.132 --> 00:04:27.733
He usually let his sister or someone else do it.

81
00:04:28.493 --> 00:04:31.695
But he'd just read a book about Life Force Locator spells.

82
00:04:32.415 --> 00:04:34.476
So he rubbed his hands together.

83
00:04:34.496 --> 00:04:38.878
"Locate!" A translucent map floated into view.

84
00:04:39.638 --> 00:04:42.920
It showed the cave and a tunnel leading off the back.

85
00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.521
The tunnel branched out into numerous other tunnels and rooms.

86
00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:50.603
"Whoa," Raff said.

87
00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:53.344
"This cave is pretty big."

88
00:04:54.216 --> 00:04:56.417
A few bright dots flashed on the map.

89
00:04:57.158 --> 00:05:01.620
When Raff squinted at them, they showed the Magica creatures that were in the cave.

90
00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:05.942
"There are only a few rock rats and bugs," Raff said.

91
00:05:05.962 --> 00:05:08.644
"I also see a bunch of buzz worms."

92
00:05:09.524 --> 00:05:11.165
Loro still looked hesitant.

93
00:05:11.705 --> 00:05:15.347
But he followed as the siblings and Muncher stepped into the cave.

94
00:05:16.008 --> 00:05:20.150
The first chamber was large, with a smooth floor and a high ceiling.

95
00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.832
A few crude, faded drawings decorated the walls.

96
00:05:24.852 --> 00:05:25.852
Zella peered at them.

97
00:05:25.872 --> 00:05:28.293
"I bet trolls drew these.

98
00:05:29.074 --> 00:05:30.454
They must have lived here once."

99
00:05:31.315 --> 00:05:34.076
"Trolls?" Loro bit his lip.

100
00:05:34.096 --> 00:05:36.657
"Don't worry," Raff said.

101
00:05:36.677 --> 00:05:41.539
"All the trolls were run out of this part of Mount Mystery a long time ago."

102
00:05:42.539 --> 00:05:43.240
Zella nodded.

103
00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.660
"They came back while Morb was around.

104
00:05:46.401 --> 00:05:48.242
But even then, we never saw any."

105
00:05:48.962 --> 00:05:52.303
The map had faded away, but Raff could still picture it.

106
00:05:52.323 --> 00:05:53.984
"That's weird.

107
00:05:54.656 --> 00:05:59.038
The map showed a tunnel leading out of this chamber, but I don't see one."

108
00:05:59.878 --> 00:06:02.900
"Maybe it collapsed," Loro said, looking around.

109
00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.901
"This whole place might be unstable."

110
00:06:05.921 --> 00:06:08.942
"Or maybe Raff's spell didn't work right."

111
00:06:10.043 --> 00:06:11.223
Zella rolled her eyes.

112
00:06:11.243 --> 00:06:16.585
"My brother often reads about magic, but he doesn't actually practice it that much."

113
00:06:17.526 --> 00:06:19.066
Raff barely heard his sister.

114
00:06:19.687 --> 00:06:24.686
He ran his hands over the solid stone wall, thinking about a book he'd read recently.

115
00:06:25.527 --> 00:06:31.152
In it, an adventurer had discovered an underground city full of passageways hidden by spells.

116
00:06:31.172 --> 00:06:35.675
"Maybe the tunnels are hidden," he thought.

117
00:06:35.696 --> 00:06:38.178
"What are you doing, Raff?"

118
00:06:38.478 --> 00:06:41.100
Loro said, edging toward the mouth of the cave.

119
00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:44.203
"It's really cold in here.

120
00:06:45.104 --> 00:06:45.784
Come on.

121
00:06:46.085 --> 00:06:47.586
Let's go back outside."

122
00:06:47.606 --> 00:06:49.488
"In a second."

123
00:06:50.588 --> 00:06:54.771
Raff rubbed his hands together, trying to remember a spell they'd learned in school.

124
00:06:55.611 --> 00:06:56.952
Then it came to him.

125
00:06:56.972 --> 00:07:02.056
"Reveal!" The air shimmered, and a tunnel appeared!
